on-arrival: {!
Q.july_2023_done = 1;
Q.konf_poll_momentum =
    (Number(Q.konf_poll_momentum) || 0) + 0.4;
Q.konf_org_resources =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_org_resources) || 0) + 2;
Q.pis_economic_position = Math.max(
    15,
    (Number(Q.pis_economic_position) || 31) - 2
);
if (Q.trz_freebie_law) {
    Q.trz_freebie_realign_pressure +=
        Q.trz_freebie_law == "marriage" ? 8 : 5;
    Q.far_right_fragmentation += 4;
    const newHope = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record && record.id == "nowa_nadzieja";
    });
    const national = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record && record.id == "ruch_narodowy";
    });
    if (newHope) newHope.organisation = Math.max(28, newHope.organisation + 2);
    if (national) national.organisation = Math.max(30, national.organisation);
}
Q.war_escalation_risk += 3;
Q.news_headline =
    "Konfederacja rises as PiS answers with welfare and border security";
!}

= July 2023 — [? if trz_freebie_law: The law becomes the right's founding grievance?][? if not trz_freebie_law: Competing answers to insecurity?]

Konfederacja is turning pandemic anger, inflation and anti-system media into a
summer surge among voters we have failed to reach. PiS answers with a larger
family benefit, while insecurity near Belarus keeps the border in every
interview. We must decide whether to contest the causes of that anger or adopt
the right's language for it.

[? if trz_freebie_law: The organisations growing fastest are not merely
protesting President Trzaskowski. Young media crews, county lawyers and parish
campaigners now describe the **[? if trz_freebie_law = "marriage": marriage-equality law?][? if trz_freebie_law = "abortion": restored abortion law?]** as proof that PiS can hold office without protecting the settlement it promised. Konfederacja offers them a party whose reason to exist is that failure.?]

