@jul23_material_result
title: Security has a bill attached
new-page: true

The costings travel further than another denunciation. Hospital closures,
rent and the tax base remain in the same argument, denying Mentzen a clean
claim on economic insecurity.[? if trz_freebie_law: The grievance survives,
but it recruits more slowly when every promise to punish the new law arrives
beside the public services that punishment would defund.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the campaign

@jul23_competence_result
title: One opposition, two definitions of normal
new-page: true

KO welcomes the common competence line and receives most of its immediate
credit. [? if trz_freebie_law: It also begins distinguishing the spectacular
extremist from the Konfederacja deputy who can be invited to discuss taxes or
procedure. The cordon has not broken; its vocabulary has acquired exceptions.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the campaign

@jul23_cordon_result
title: Every microphone carries the question
new-page: true

The coalition question follows every leader through the week. Refusal remains
the democratic camp's public answer, while Konfederacja uses the attention to
advertise itself as the party everybody else fears.[? if trz_freebie_law: The
line delays institutional normalisation even as it enlarges the grievance's
audience.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the campaign

@jul23_copy_result
title: The premise changes sides
new-page: true

The stricter language wins a few interviews and tells every threatened group
that the argument is now only about who will administer the right's programme.
[? if trz_freebie_law: County officials testing refusals of the new law hear no
national party defend a hard boundary. What began as defiance starts to look
like an administrative interpretation waiting for a different minister.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the campaign
